      "NAME LIKELY CORRECTED (research 2026-07-03): the compiled PEI Morrow family register (islandregister.com/morrow1.html) names Eunice Coffin's husband as 'John (Jr.) Morrow,' married ca. 1785 — not 'William John Morrow (Morrogh).' 'William' appears to be a conflation with their youngest son, William Morrow (b. ca. 1805). The couple had (at least) eight recorded children per that source: Abigail, Elisha, John III, James, Andrew, Thomas, Benjamin, and William — more than the three currently listed here."
